map.cave of gerfrex.guards.17.5.1.messag:
A carrier pigeon lands on your arm bearing a message--how it ever found you down here in these winding underground caves you'll never know!

The message reads:
{I will be home soon, back from my latest conquest up} {north (it's cold and} {snowy there and the wizards} {have frost in their beards..ha ha).} {Anyway,} {I'll} {be back soon,} {so look for me in the tavern the beginning of} {next week.}
{-- Your big dumb brother, Crag Hack}
{P.S. I'm still alive so you owe me a drink.}}
